Changes in this fork
--------------------

- Added an opt-in macOS-style appearance: a horizontal bar of window icons with
  the selected window's title beneath it. Selected with `"style": "bar"`. The
  default remains `"list"`, the original list card, so behavior is unchanged
  unless the user opts in.
- Generalized icon resolution with a user-configurable `iconOverrides` list
  (match by window class, optionally by title) instead of hard-coding a single
  application's icon.

